    "semantic_summary": "This module acts as a backward-compatibility shim, maintaining legacy import patterns for built-in tools and the PROJECT_ROOT variable. It aggregates functionality from specialized, modern tool modules (filesystem, search, shell, web, notify) into a centralized registry, AVAILABLE_TOOLS. It also implements _CompatModule to intercept and forward PROJECT_ROOT state changes for older consumers, ensuring application continuity during migration."
